{"obsah":"<p>Probably the last outdoor exhibition of the year is history. This time the weather was kind, and the team of Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček, Michal Budský and Márty Kabeláč could fire off exhibition tricks in front of the town leadership on the asphalt surface near the pump track. </p>\n\n<p>The pump track itself was created by digging out soil for a pond by the cycle path and is made of earth with fine gravel on the surface. Thanks to its proximity to the cycle path and the National Agricultural Museum, there will be no shortage of visitors. Besides our team, the guys from BMX Pardubice came to test it, and after the show Michal and Márty joined them and tested it like their lives depended on it.</p>\n\n<p>The event organisers are also talented photographers, so this time we have exceptionally great photos from the event.</p>\n\n<p></p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F11%2FDSC_6747-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F11%2FDSC_6747.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-213455\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F11%2FDSC_6732-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F11%2FDSC_6732.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-213456\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F11%2FDSC_6979-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F11%2FDSC_6979.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-213453\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F11%2FDSC_7071-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F11%2FDSC_7071.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-213454\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F11%2FDSC_6585-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F11%2FDSC_6585.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-213457\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F11%2FDSC_6630-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F11%2FDSC_6630.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-213458\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F11%2FDSC_6685-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F11%2FDSC_6685.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-213461\"/></a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Čáslav</figcaption></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F11%2FIMG_9877-EM-1-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F11%2FIMG_9877-EM-1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-213462\"/></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n<p></p>"}